い","creatorId":"vndb:s272","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s272","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s272","name":"榊原 ゆい","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:53899:86640:4916:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c55904","characterName":"高屋 すくね","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"86954","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"53899"},{"characterId":"86954","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"77394"}],"egsCharacterIds":["14473"],"vndbCharacterId":"c55904"},"originalCharacterName":"高屋 すくね","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"【お姉さま】"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"学園の生徒会長で、生徒たちの憧れの的。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"容姿端麗、才色兼備、資産家の娘で将来も有望。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その上、性格までも非の打ち所がないというまさにパーフェクトな女の子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"弾き手を選ぶ特殊な楽器『フォルテール』の奏者だが、なぜかフォルテールを遠ざけている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"幼なじみのかぐらは、完璧過ぎるすくねに対してどこか違和感があるようだ。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"14473","sourceWorkId":"13008","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"学園の生徒会長で、生徒たちの憧れの的。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"容姿端麗、才色兼備、資産家の娘で将来も有望。さらに性格までも非の打ち所がないというまさにパーフェクト。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"弾き手を選ぶ特殊な楽器『フォルテール』の奏者だが、なぜかフォルテールを遠ざけている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"幼なじみのかぐらは、完璧過ぎるすくねに対してどこか違和感があるようだ。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"86954"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/55/55d59be140ee619f37784de882e277e168f835ea2985f0e0422b4b667fd13e30.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/fb/fb939c02835d351285ca2e4796438e3d6f9859901da67647e8405220524ac5b9.webp","width":130,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"たかはし智秋","creatorId":"vndb:s287","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s287","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s287","name":"たかはし 智秋","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:53899:86954:4604:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c55905","characterName":"ゆうな","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[],"egsCharacterIds":["14479"],"vndbCharacterId":"c55905"},"originalCharacterName":"ゆうな","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"【？？？】"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"学苑の最寄駅の商店街で演奏をするストリートミュージシャン。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"１７歳くらいのストリートミュージシャンという以外は謎。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"人前で演奏することだけあって、わりと強気で自信家ですが、自信過剰な鼻持ちならないタイプではなく、自由奔放でバイタリティあふれる、何事にも前向きな女の子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ストリートミュージシャンとしては珍しいフォルテール奏者。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"14479","sourceWorkId":"13008","spoiler":false}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/53/53bcb5ff8cfacdd6bac7f91b4f6ced1f50f6c5aa981fea0fde794740b735a2f7.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/42/42d3fab06f825ddf81f18f165fa40c0e8f7a0b88eec06ea15d4cabada988f37c.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"たかはし 智秋","creatorId":"vndb:s287","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s287","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s287","name":"たかはし 智秋","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:16858","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_c55906","characterName":"幸村 ちほ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"88376","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"53899"},{"characterId":"88376","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"77394"}],"egsCharacterIds":["14494"],"vndbCharacterId":"c55906"},"originalCharacterName":"幸村 ちほ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"【親友】"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公である宮藤かぐらの親友で幼なじみ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"明るくて、いつも周囲を笑顔にする、クラスのムードメーカー的な存在の元気な女の子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"いつもドタバタと賑やかなので、遠くからでもどこに居るのかすぐにわかる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"父親はバイオリニスト、母親が声楽家という音楽一家。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そんな家に生まれということもあり音楽家になることを期待されている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"14494","sourceWorkId":"13008","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公である宮藤かぐらの親友で幼なじみ。明るくて、いつも周囲を笑顔にする日向のようで、クラスのムードメーカー的な存在の元気な女の子。いつもドタバタと賑やかなので、遠くからでも良く目立つ。父親はバイオリニスト、母親が声楽家という音楽一家に生まれたため音楽家になることを期待されているが、本人は動物が好きなこともあり、獣医を目指したいと思っている。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"88376"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/84/8461734f11596cbc3a5a3a6e87fd5785e9d44c2e4075c62de44cf83a175315cf.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f0/f03be7caefed5a5518155bd0a64860b92ea7734b2361ae0bcfd821254e225e65.webp","width":106,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"伊月ゆい","creatorId":"vndb:s515","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s515","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s515","name":"伊月 ゆい","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:53899:88376:4682:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c55907","characterName":"天野 まり","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"90231","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"53899"},{"characterId":"90231","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"77394"}],"egsCharacterIds":["14474"],"vndbCharacterId":"c55907"},"originalCharacterName":"天野 まり","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"【先輩】"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"生徒会のメンバーの一人で書記。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"他の生徒たちと同じように高屋すくねに憧れている一人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"プライドが高く、相手に容赦ない言葉を浴びせる気の強い女の子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ルール至上主義者。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"予想外の突発的な事象への対処は苦手。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"14474","sourceWorkId":"13008","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"生徒会のメンバーの1人で、役職は書記。フォルテール奏者の1人でもあり、校内でも5本の指に入る程の実力を持っている。すくねに憧れているのだが、すくねに気に入られているかぐらに嫉妬し、かぐらに対して高圧的な態度で接してくる。だが対称的に琴美のことを妹のように大切に想っており、彼女に対してだけは一転してとても優しい態度になる。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"90231"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/dd/ddda895ea803789482d3aa574ac827565d34689d7c69456520b84f6de9e67b85.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/fc/fcd9e87b1396a75c272d0f25ad8fdec9a9032f894c7e4e3808d3a6d5d59626b6.webp","width":104,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"今井麻美","creatorId":"vndb:s240","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s240","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s240","name":"今井麻美","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:53899:90231:4061:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c55908","characterName":"二条院 琴美","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"90269","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"53899"}],"egsCharacterIds":["14476"],"vndbCharacterId":"c55908"},"originalCharacterName":"二条院 琴美","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"【同級生】"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"物静かであまり喋らないが、暗いわけではなく、必要なことを必要なだけ言葉にする。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"友達思いで、さりげない気遣いができる女の子。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"14476","sourceWorkId":"13008","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"ツインテールが特徴の女の子で、生徒会のメンバーの1人。物静かであまり喋らないが、それでも性格自体は明るく芯はとても強い。ちほとは寮の同じ部屋に住むルームメイト。料理が得意で、毎日ちほの為にお菓子を作ってあげている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"過去にフォルテールの英才教育を受けていたことがあるのだが小さい音しか出せずに伸び悩み、声楽に転向したという経歴を持っている。これはPSP版で攻略可能キャラに昇格した際に、新たに付け加えられた設定である。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"90269"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/80/803969e09d709fb566cbce8400966a5663c6efe71eabb5ad3153d11b49b0b609.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/63/63390ba2965d00685170217a949e7981e2f5cd715c30cf5dfa211a1f8c48db43.webp","width":102,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"藤田咲","creatorId":"vndb:s1770","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1770","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1770","name":"藤田 咲","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:53899:90269:5014:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c55909","characterName":"垣之内 雅","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"220406","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"53899"},{"characterId":"220406","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"77394"}],"egsCharacterIds":["14475"],"vndbCharacterId":"c55909"},"originalCharacterName":"垣之内 雅","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"【先輩】"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"生徒会のメンバーで会計をしている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"従順でおとなしそうな感じの女の子なのだが、内心はプライドが高くて意地悪。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"いつもは良い生徒を演じており、周囲の人間を見事に欺いている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"日本人とギリシャ人とのハーフ。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"14475","sourceWorkId":"13008","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"生徒会のメンバーで会計をしている。従順でおとなしそうな感じの女の子なのだが、内心はプライドが高くて意地悪。いつもは良い生徒を演じている。演技力は高く、周囲の人間を見事に欺いている。日本人とギリシャ人とのハーフ。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"220406"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/9c/9c09271d0fa3528843e2b60bb7b884c2fc641f964947375c23bc944c78693c20.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/88/882ec5ea1edf4e3ab227fa18806bfc7baf631aa49e94ca859f567c6e7e0129f4.webp","width":128,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"今野宏美","creatorId":"vndb:s8126","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s8126","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s8126","name":"今野 宏美","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:53899:220406:4457:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c55911","characterName":"二波 織歌","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"220404","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"224507"},{"characterId":"220404","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"53899"}],"egsCharacterIds":["14478"],"vndbCharacterId":"c55911"},"originalCharacterName":"二波 織歌","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"【後輩】"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"桜立舎学苑に入学してきた１年生。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"フォルテール奏者として天才の域に達しており、桜立舎学苑の特別待遇生。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"約一年前にかぐらのストリートライブを見て、かぐらが生まれて初めて気になる存在として脳裏に残り戸惑う。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"頭の回転が速く、ときおり口を開くときは、相手の言うことの数歩先を見据えての発言が多い。"}],"sourc